window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Eighteen-year-old high school student Serina Night wants peace between vampire and humankind, when she realizes there's something incredibly special about her.</p> <p><i>The Vampire and Her Element</i> is a mesmerizing, jaw-dropping romance fiction book with magic that follows Serina Night, half human half vampire, through her journey with love, heartbreak, betrayal, action, and twists around every corner.</p> <p>Follow her through her journey as she finds out the real truth about her family and who she really is as she learns about her newfound power and becomes one of the strongest vampires to ever live. Follow her story as she fights werewolves, vampires, and demons. This epic book is a must-have for any listener.</p>"; 
